ed."],"distress_risk":["**Cohance Lifesciences** -- Telangana PCB orders closure of its Suryapet plant after a fatal industrial accident; the company is seeking cancellation, no financial impact stated.","**Coffee Day Enterprises** -- SAT sets aside SEBI's 24-Jan-2023 order imposing a Rs 26 cr penalty (~4.0% of mcap, our arithmetic); the company is weighing its next step.","**GVK Power & Infrastructure** (under CIRP) -- NCLT Hyderabad restores its insolvency process by order of 16-Oct and directs completion within a further 120 days.","**Ushdev International** (in liquidation) -- two auction rounds have sold wind turbines and some immovable properties; the next round, mainly immovables and securities, is due soon."],"other_notable":["**Zaggle Prepaid Ocean Services** -- amends its January-2025 agreement with Siemens, revising the commercial terms; the amended terms are not quantified in the filing.","**Dharti Proteins Ltd** — The company has fixed Friday, November 13, 2026 as the record date for Bonus Issue of 75,000 equity shares of Rs. 10/- each aggregating to Rs. 7,50,000/-."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ELEGANZ_06112026131259_Disclosures_for_Reg_30-Contract-.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null}],"equity_allotments":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/KABRAEXTRU_06112026101103_IntimationSigned.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null}],"m_and_a":[{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/nishant_joshi_adani_com_06112026121716_AELIntimationVizagMegaDataCenterParkLimited06112026.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/Apekshakhemka_06112026135439_Pininfarina__S